<li>their ability to locate <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">3</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="3" name="question_3" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[3] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> using a scent trail</li>
<li>the effect that  <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">4</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="4" name="question_4" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[4] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> had on them</li>
<li>how <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">5</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="5" name="question_5" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[5] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span>. They attacked prey</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Brains:</strong></p>
<ul>
